@KatiePavlich: I support the SCOTUS ruling because I don't believe in drawing congressional districts based on race because that's racist.

@briantylercohen: You're being purposefully obtuse and your viewers can see it.

KP: You're being purposefully obtuse!

BTC: They know exactly what it means when you crack a district where there are overwhelmingly Black or Brown voters and their voting power is diluted. This is exactly the impetus for the 1965 VRA.

KP: Great to see you! [ends interview]

